WEBVTT

28:01.331 --> 28:03.250
- Let me go.
- Never.

28:03.375 --> 28:07.128
- Let me go.
- The boy won't talk.

28:08.088 --> 28:10.215
And if he does, I'll kill him.

28:10.340 --> 28:13.677
Him, Ned Stark, the king -
the whole bloody lot of them,

28:13.802 --> 28:18.265
until you and I are the only people
left in this world.

28:29.317 --> 28:31.236
I wish I could see the girls.
